{"id":"mahabharata-7-032","work":"mahabharata","part":7,"partName":"द्रोणपर्व","partNameEn":"Drona Parva","unit":32,"title":"द्वात्रिंशत्तमोऽध्यायः","titleEn":"Adhyaya 32 · The new day: Drona plans the wheel array","summary":{"en":"The next day Duryodhana complains to Drona that he failed again to capture Yudhishthira, and Drona replies that Arjuna must be drawn away. Drona then forms the Chakravyuha, which only Arjuna and Abhimanyu among the Pandavas know how to enter.","kn":"ಮರುದಿನ ಯುಧಿಷ್ಠಿರನನ್ನು ಹಿಡಿಯಲಾಗಲಿಲ್ಲವೆಂದು ದುರ್ಯೋಧನ ದೂರುತ್ತಾನೆ; ಅರ್ಜುನನನ್ನು ದೂರ ಸೆಳೆಯಬೇಕೆಂದು ದ್ರೋಣ ಉತ್ತರಿಸುತ್ತಾನೆ. ದ್ರೋಣ ಚಕ್ರವ್ಯೂಹ ರಚಿಸುತ್ತಾನೆ; ಪಾಂಡವರಲ್ಲಿ ಅರ್ಜುನ, ಅಭಿಮನ್ಯು ಮಾತ್ರ ಅದರೊಳಗೆ ಪ್ರವೇಶಿಸಬಲ್ಲರು.","hi":"अगले दिन दुर्योधन शिकायत करता है कि द्रोण फिर युधिष्ठिर को नहीं पकड़ सके, और द्रोण कहते हैं कि अर्जुन को दूर खींचना होगा। द्रोण चक्रव्यूह बनाते हैं, जिसमें पाण्डवों में केवल अर्जुन और अभिमन्यु प्रवेश करना जानते हैं।","te":"మరుసటి రోజు యుధిష్ఠిరుని పట్టుకోలేదని దుర్యోధనుడు ఆక్షేపిస్తాడు; అర్జునుని దూరం చేయాలని ద్రోణుడు బదులిస్తాడు. ద్రోణుడు చక్రవ్యూహం పన్నుతాడు; పాండవులలో అర్జునుడు, అభిమన్యుడు మాత్రమే దాని లోపలికి ప్రవేశించగలరు.","ta":"மறுநாள் யுதிஷ்டிரரைப் பிடிக்கவில்லை என்று துரியோதனன் குறை கூற, அர்ஜுனனை விலக்கவேண்டும் என்று த்ரோணர் பதிலளிக்கிறார். த்ரோணர் சக்கர வியூகம் அமைக்கிறார்; பாண்டவரில் அர்ஜுனனும் அபிமன்யுவும் மட்டுமே அதில் நுழையத் தெரிந்தவர்.","ml":"പിറ്റേന്ന് യുധിഷ്ഠിരനെ വീണ്ടും പിടികൂടാനായില്ലെന്ന് ദുര്യോധനൻ ദ്രോണരോട് പരാതിപ്പെടുന്നു; അർജുനനെ അകറ്റണമെന്ന് ദ്രോണർ മറുപടി നൽകുന്നു. പിന്നീട് ദ്രോണർ ചക്രവ്യൂഹം ചമയ്ക്കുന്നു; പാണ്ഡവരിൽ അർജുനനും അഭിമന്യുവും മാത്രമാണ് അതിൽ കടക്കാനറിയുന്നത്."},"source":"Mahabharata, Critical Edition (BORI, Pune) 7.32; e-text by M. Tokunaga and J. D. Smith, © BORI 1999, version of Tue Sep 22 2026","sections":[{"title":"अभिमन्युवधपर्व","titleEn":"Abhimanyuvadha Parva (Slaying of Abhimanyu)","verses":[{"text":"संजय उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Sanjaya said:"}},{"n":1,"text":"पूर्वमस्मासु भग्नेषु फल्गुनेनामितौजसा ।\nद्रोणे च मोघसंकल्पे रक्षिते च युधिष्ठिरे ॥","meaning":{"en":"Earlier, when we had been broken by the boundlessly mighty Phalguna, when Drona's design had failed and Yudhishthira had been kept safe,"}},{"n":2,"text":"सर्वे विध्वस्तकवचास्तावका युधि निर्जिताः ।\nरजस्वला भृशोद्विग्ना वीक्षमाणा दिशो दश ॥","meaning":{"en":"all your men in the battle were beaten, their armor shattered, dust-covered, deeply troubled, looking in all ten directions."}},{"n":3,"text":"अवहारं ततः कृत्वा भारद्वाजस्य संमते ।\nलब्धलक्ष्यैः परैर्दीना भृशावहसिता रणे ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then, with Bharadvaja's son's approval, the recall was sounded; dejected, much mocked in the battle by the enemy who had won their aim,"}},{"n":4,"text":"श्लाघमानेषु भूतेषु फल्गुनस्यामितान्गुणान् ।\nकेशवस्य च सौहार्दे कीर्त्यमानेऽर्जुनं प्रति ।\nअभिशस्ता इवाभूवन्ध्यानमूकत्वमास्थिताः ॥","meaning":{"en":"while the people praised Phalguna's boundless virtues and spoke of Keshava's friendship toward Arjuna, your men were as if cursed, sunk in thought and silence."}},{"n":5,"text":"ततः प्रभातसमये द्रोणं दुर्योधनोऽब्रवीत् ।\nप्रणयादभिमानाच्च द्विषद्वृद्ध्या च दुर्मनाः ।\nशृण्वतां सर्वभूतानां संरब्धो वाक्यकोविदः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then at dawn Duryodhana, displeased, spoke to Drona out of affection, pride and the enemy's growth, angry and skilled in words, while all beings listened."}},{"n":6,"text":"नूनं वयं वध्यपक्षे भवतो ब्रह्मवित्तम ।\nतथा हि नाग्रहीः प्राप्तं समीपेऽद्य युधिष्ठिरम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"\"Best of Brahmin knowers, surely we are on the side of those to be killed by you; for you did not seize Yudhishthira when he was close at hand today.\""}},{"n":7,"text":"इच्छतस्ते न मुच्येत चक्षुःप्राप्तो रणे रिपुः ।\nजिघृक्षतो रक्ष्यमाणः सामरैरपि पाण्डवैः ॥","meaning":{"en":"\"If you wished it, an enemy who came before your eyes in battle would not escape, and yet he is guarded, though you wish to seize him, by the Pandavas with even the gods.\""}},{"n":8,"text":"वरं दत्त्वा मम प्रीतः पश्चाद्विकृतवानसि ।\nआशाभङ्गं न कुर्वन्ति भक्तस्यार्याः कथंचन ॥","meaning":{"en":"\"You were pleased and gave me a boon, and afterward you turned it around. Noble men never disappoint the hope of a devoted follower.\""}},{"n":9,"text":"ततोऽप्रीतस्तथोक्तः स भारद्वाजोऽब्रवीन्नृपम् ।\nनार्हसे मान्यथा ज्ञातुं घटमानं तव प्रिये ॥","meaning":{"en":"Thus addressed, Bharadvaja's son, displeased, said to the king: \"You should not think otherwise of me, who am striving for what pleases you.\""}},{"n":10,"text":"ससुरासुरगन्धर्वाः सयक्षोरगराक्षसाः ।\nनालं लोका रणे जेतुं पाल्यमानं किरीटिना ॥","meaning":{"en":"\"Gods, Asuras, Gandharvas, Yakshas, Nagas and Rakshasas together are not able to beat in battle one who is guarded by Kiritin.\""}},{"n":11,"text":"विश्वसृग्यत्र गोविन्दः पृतनारिस्तथार्जुनः ।\nतत्र कस्य बलं क्रामेदन्यत्र त्र्यम्बकात्प्रभोः ॥","meaning":{"en":"\"Where Govinda, creator of the universe, and Arjuna, destroyer of armies, are, whose strength could prevail, except that of the Lord Tryambaka?\""}},{"n":12,"text":"सत्यं तु ते ब्रवीम्यद्य नैतज्जात्वन्यथा भवेत् ।\nअद्यैषां प्रवरं वीरं पातयिष्ये महारथम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"\"But I tell you the truth today, and it will never be otherwise: today I will bring down the best hero and great chariot-warrior among them.\""}},{"n":13,"text":"तं च व्यूहं विधास्यामि योऽभेद्यस्त्रिदशैरपि ।\nयोगेन केनचिद्राजन्नर्जुनस्त्वपनीयताम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"\"And I will form an array that even the gods cannot break; but by some stratagem, O king, Arjuna must be drawn away.\""}},{"n":14,"text":"न ह्यज्ञातमसाध्यं वा तस्य संख्येऽस्ति किंचन ।\nतेन ह्युपात्तं बलवत्सर्वज्ञानमितस्ततः ॥","meaning":{"en":"\"For there is nothing in battle unknown or impossible to him; he has gathered all knowledge from here and there, with strength.\""}},{"n":15,"text":"द्रोणेन व्याहृते त्वेवं संशप्तकगणाः पुनः ।\nआह्वयन्नर्जुनं संख्ये दक्षिणामभितो दिशम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"When Drona had spoken so, the bands of Samshaptakas again challenged Arjuna in battle toward the southern quarter."}},{"n":16,"text":"तत्रार्जुनस्याथ परैः सार्धं समभवद्रणः ।\nतादृशो यादृशो नान्यः श्रुतो दृष्टोऽपि वा क्वचित् ॥","meaning":{"en":"There a battle began between Arjuna and the enemies such as has never been heard or seen anywhere else."}},{"n":17,"text":"ततो द्रोणेन विहितो राजन्व्यूहो व्यरोचत ।\nचरन्मध्यंदिने सूर्यः प्रतपन्निव दुर्दृशः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then the array formed by Drona shone, O king, hard to look at, like the sun at midday blazing."}},{"n":18,"text":"तं चाभिमन्युर्वचनात्पितुर्ज्येष्ठस्य भारत ।\nबिभेद दुर्भिदं संख्ये चक्रव्यूहमनेकधा ॥","meaning":{"en":"And Abhimanyu, at the command of his father's elder brother, O Bharata, broke the hard-to-break wheel array in many places in the battle."}},{"n":19,"text":"स कृत्वा दुष्करं कर्म हत्वा वीरान्सहस्रशः ।\nषट्सु वीरेषु संसक्तो दौःशासनिवशं गतः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Having done that hard deed and killed heroes by thousands, he was caught up with six heroes and fell into the power of Duhshasana's son."}},{"n":20,"text":"वयं परमसंहृष्टाः पाण्डवाः शोककर्शिताः ।\nसौभद्रे निहते राजन्नवहारमकुर्वत ॥","meaning":{"en":"We were greatly delighted, while the Pandavas were wasted with grief; when Subhadra's son was killed, O king, they sounded the recall."}},{"text":"धृतराष्ट्र उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Dhritarashtra said:"}},{"n":21,"text":"पुत्रं पुरुषसिंहस्य संजयाप्राप्तयौवनम् ।\nरणे विनिहतं श्रुत्वा भृशं मे दीर्यते मनः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Hearing, Sanjaya, that the son of that lion among men, still short of youth, was killed in battle, my heart is torn badly."}},{"n":22,"text":"दारुणः क्षत्रधर्मोऽयं विहितो धर्मकर्तृभिः ।\nयत्र राज्येप्सवः शूरा बाले शस्त्रमपातयन् ॥","meaning":{"en":"This is a cruel Kshatriya way, laid down by makers of dharma, in which brave men eager for a kingdom struck a boy with weapons."}},{"n":23,"text":"बालमत्यन्तसुखिनं विचरन्तमभीतवत् ।\nकृतास्त्रा बहवो जघ्नुर्ब्रूहि गावल्गणे कथम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Tell me, son of Gavalgana, how many skilled warriors killed that boy, who ranged fearlessly, accustomed to great ease."}},{"n":24,"text":"बिभित्सता रथानीकं सौभद्रेणामितौजसा ।\nविक्रीडितं यथा संख्ये तन्ममाचक्ष्व संजय ॥","meaning":{"en":"Tell me, Sanjaya, how Subhadra's son, of boundless strength, wishing to break the chariot division, sported in battle."}},{"text":"संजय उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Sanjaya said:"}},{"n":25,"text":"यन्मां पृच्छसि राजेन्द्र सौभद्रस्य निपातनम् ।\nतत्ते कार्त्स्न्येन वक्ष्यामि शृणु राजन्समाहितः ।\nविक्रीडितं कुमारेण यथानीकं बिभित्सता ॥","meaning":{"en":"Since you ask me, king of kings, about the fall of Subhadra's son, I will tell you all of it; listen with attention, O king, how the youth sported, wishing to break the division."}},{"n":26,"text":"दावाग्न्यभिपरीतानां भूरिगुल्मतृणद्रुमे ।\nवनौकसामिवारण्ये त्वदीयानामभूद्भयम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Fear came upon your men, like forest creatures in a jungle thick with bushes, grass and trees, surrounded by a forest fire."}}]}]}